{"text_id":1,"forms":["How are you doing?<br>I’ve been having a fun day fishing—as always!<br><br>By the way, have Pokémon started changing where<br>they live? Recently I’ve fished up Pokémon that I used<br>to only see in different regions. Maybe you’ll catch<br>something rare where you are, too!<br><br>Love,<br>Your Fishing Fanatic Little Bro"],"absolute_byte_offsets":[577],"raw_metadata_u32":[1]}
{"text_id":2,"forms":["The price of vegetables has really gone up here in<br>Viridian City since there’s been so little rain this year.<br>Are things OK where you are, Douglas? I hope all<br>that electricity in your city is making life a little easier<br>over there.<br><br>Anyway, if you ever need help, just let me know<br>and I’ll send you some vegetables.<br><br>Love,<br>Mom"],"absolute_byte_offsets":[910],"raw_metadata_u32":[1]}
{"text_id":3,"forms":["Thanks for the letter!<br><br>These days, I’ve been fishing up a huge haul of<br>Horsea. There are just so many to catch—I’m having<br>an absolute blast!<br><br>I’ll visit you sometime soon, so let’s go fishing<br>together then.<br><br>Love,<br>Your Fishing Fanatic Big Bro"],"absolute_byte_offsets":[1271],"raw_metadata_u32":[1]}
{"text_id":4,"forms":["Thank you for entering our recent drawing for the<br>EZ Kitchenware Set!<br><br>We are excited to inform you that your name was<br>selected! Please find your kitchenware set enclosed.<br>Happy cooking!"],"absolute_byte_offsets":[1555],"raw_metadata_u32":[1]}
{"text_id":5,"forms":["Look at this cute photo of Rio! I took it when Growly<br>(who just moved in next door) came over to play.<br><br>Doesn’t she look happy?! Lately, she’s been spending<br>every free minute playing with Growly. At this rate,<br>she’ll probably forget all about you!<br><br>Just kidding! But if you’re worried about that, maybe<br>you should finally visit next summer break!"],"absolute_byte_offsets":[1757],"raw_metadata_u32":[1]}
{"text_id":6,"forms":["All Smiles Preschool had a busy month! Here are a<br>few of the highlights.<br><br>On the second, we had our Nap Time Event!<br>Our sweet children all took a nap with Snorlax.<br>They seemed to fall asleep much faster than usual!<br><br>The eleventh was our Walk Together Event!<br>We all went out for a nice walk together around town.<br>The children did a great job. Very little complaining!"],"absolute_byte_offsets":[2136],"raw_metadata_u32":[10]}
